OL,3,CMan denies shooting murder of father
OL,4,Cat family farm
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man has denied the
OL,7,Fmurder of his father in a shooting at
OL,8,Ftheir family farm.
OL,10,FAdam Olverson appeared before
OL,11,Fmagistrates in June 2026 to face a
OL,12,Fcharge of manslaughter over the death
OL,13,Fof Thomas Olverson, 75, in
OL,14,FScarisbrick, Lancashire, on 25 July
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FThe defendant made his first
OL,18,Fappearance at Preston Crown Court on
OL,19,FWednesday, 29 July, where the fresh
OL,20,Fallegation of murder was put to him.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
