OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785394080
OL,3,CMan denies shooting murder of father
OL,4,Cat family farm
OL,6,FOlverson entered not guilty pleas to
OL,7,Fboth murder and manslaughter, and also
OL,8,Fdenied possessing a double-barrelled,
OL,9,Fside-by-side 12-bore hammer shotgun
OL,10,Fwithout a certificate.
OL,12,FThe Recorder of Preston, Judge Robert
OL,13,FAltham, granted him bail ahead of a
OL,14,Fpre-trial review on 22 February 2027.
OL,16,FAmong the defendant's bail conditions
OL,17,Fare he must reside at his home address
OL,18,Fof Marsh Hey Farm in Pinfold Lane,
OL,19,Fabide by a night-time curfew and must
OL,20,Fsurrender his passport.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
