OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785394080
OL,3,CMan denies shooting murder of father
OL,4,Cat family farm
OL,6,FA trial date of 19 April 2027 was
OL,7,Ffixed with an estimated length of up
OL,8,Fto three weeks.
OL,10,FThomas Olverson was pronounced dead at
OL,11,Fthe farm as emergency services
OL,12,Fattended following a report of a
OL,13,Fgunfire discharge in a field off
OL,14,FPinfold Lane.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/3
